1
00:00:00,048 --> 00:00:03,508
l have spent my whole life
trying to bring order to the universe...

2
00:00:03,718 --> 00:00:06,348
(Sheldon:)...by carefully planning
every moment of every day.

3
00:00:06,554 --> 00:00:10,054
(Sheldon:)But all my efforts, our dinner schedule,
my pajama rotation...

4
00:00:10,266 --> 00:00:12,226
(Sheldon:)...my bowel movement spreadsheet...

5
00:00:13,853 --> 00:00:16,563
(Sheldon:)It's clear now,
l've been wasting my time.

6
00:00:17,357 --> 00:00:20,777
(Leonard:)Good. I'm taking that disgusting chart
off the fridge.

7
00:00:21,319 --> 00:00:22,779
(Howard:)You know...

8
00:00:22,987 --> 00:00:25,277
(Penny:)...sometimes it's nice
not knowing what's coming.

9
00:00:25,490 --> 00:00:26,570
(Penny:)Look at me and Leonard.

10
00:00:26,783 --> 00:00:28,493
We went out, broke up,
trying again.

11
00:00:28,701 --> 00:00:30,121
(Penny:)We don't know what's gonna happen.

12
00:00:30,328 --> 00:00:32,788
(Sheldon:)Oh, please, everyone knows
what's going to happen.

13
00:00:35,249 --> 00:00:36,579
(Sheldon:)But I see your point.

14
00:00:36,793 --> 00:00:38,423
l think this could be good for you.

15
00:00:38,628 --> 00:00:41,798
(Leonard:)Maybe it's time for you
to shake things up a bit.

16
00:00:42,131 --> 00:00:43,341
(Sheldon:)You're right.

17
00:00:43,549 --> 00:00:45,219
l should embrace the chaos.

18
00:00:46,636 --> 00:00:49,556
- Great. What are you gonna do first?
- l don't know.

19
00:00:49,764 --> 00:00:53,474
l could do anything. All bets are off.

20
00:00:53,685 --> 00:00:57,025
(Sheldon:)The world is my oyster.

